  <item rdf:about="2026/0810-yakitori/">
            <title>2026/08/10: 焼鳥屋</title>
        <link>https://www.don.to/diary/2026/0810-yakitori/</link>
        <description><![CDATA[<p>近所の持ち帰り焼鳥屋。17:40オープンで18時過ぎに並んでギリギリ一通り残ってた。</p>

<p><a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20260810180635" data-timestamp="2026-08-10 18:06:35"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a>
<a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20260810181609" data-timestamp="2026-08-10 18:16:09"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a></p>
]]></description>
        <dc:date>2026-2026-08T00:00:00+09:00</dc:date>

  </item>
